        "created_at": "2015-01-15T02:12:44.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Perhaps this was answered before but I couldnt find it with a search. &nbsp;If you are dealt 0 damage are you considered to have take. Damage for game effects? &nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Example if wraith has combat stance (the first time you are dealt damage a turn deal the source of that damage 2 miles damage) out and sky scraper uses her huge power reall all non hero targets 2 sonic and all hero targets 0 sonic damage). Does combat stance activate dealing 2 damage to sky scraper?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>because I had capt cosmic with his construct that lets him use powers when dealt damage and I was using powers all over the place. &nbsp;Was that legal?</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
