        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "[quote=\"HappiestMeal\"]\n\nPerhaps this was answered before but I couldnt find it with a search. &nbsp;If you are dealt 0 damage are you considered to have take. Damage for game effects? &nbsp;&nbsp;Example if wraith has combat stance (the first time you are dealt damage a turn deal the source of that damage 2 miles damage) out and sky scraper uses her huge power reall all non hero targets 2 sonic and all hero targets 0 sonic damage). Does combat stance activate dealing 2 damage to sky scraper?\n\n[/quote]\n\ncombat stance would not activate unless you were actually dealt one or more damage. &nbsp;If the final result is zero damage then combat stance would not activate. &nbsp;\n\n> \n\nbecause I had capt cosmic with his construct that lets him use powers when dealt damage and I was using powers all over the place. &nbsp;Was that legal?\n\nFor the constructs that require damage to activate they need to be dealt at least one damage and still be in play after the damage is dealt. &nbsp;\n\nEdit: dang ninjaed by Pydro\n\n&nbsp;\n",
